// Embeds app.manifest as the primary application manifest resource
// (resource ID 1, resource type 24 = RT_MANIFEST). Windows reads this
// exact resource name/type combination from the main executable to
// decide the process's requested execution level (requireAdministrator)
// and other manifest-declared settings -- see app.manifest and the
// project devlog, 2026-11-17 packaging entry, for why.
1 24 "app.manifest"
